  "description": "IQACOU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H62 Dy4 N48 Ni6 O18 2+,5(C1 H4 O1),2(Cl1 O4 1-),2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 1 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 1 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 1 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Ni4 (Ni) has 1 O neighbors; Ni5 (Ni) has 1 O neighbors; Ni6 (Ni) has 1 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.628-4.067 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.94-121.87°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C73H88Cl2Dy4N50Ni6O31. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
